WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.438 --> 00:00:03.338
Lesson fourteen. Insects!

2
00:00:04.289 --> 00:00:11.372
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.313 --> 00:00:15.039
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.089 --> 00:00:18.200
Today we learn: Insects! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.945 --> 00:00:22.312
Ant! Say it with me. Ant!

6
00:00:26.295 --> 00:00:29.395
Bee! Say it with me. Bee!

7
00:00:33.407 --> 00:00:36.974
Butterfly! Say it with me. Butterfly!

8
00:00:40.931 --> 00:00:44.231
Spider! Say it with me. Spider!

9
00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:52.400
Ladybug! Say it with me. Ladybug!

10
00:00:56.331 --> 00:00:59.964
Fly! Say it with me. Fly!

11
00:01:03.993 --> 00:01:07.643
Grasshopper! Say it with me. Grasshopper!

12
00:01:11.669 --> 00:01:15.252
Beetle! Say it with me. Beetle!

13
00:01:19.231 --> 00:01:25.746
Listen. The bee can fly. The ant can crawl.

14
00:01:25.796 --> 00:01:30.807
Say it with me. The bee can fly. The ant can crawl.

15
00:01:35.714 --> 00:01:41.371
The little ant carries food to its home. A colorful butterfly flies near the flowers.

16
00:01:41.421 --> 00:01:42.747
I like this story!

17
00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:48.917
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.967 --> 00:01:50.117
Butterfly!

19
00:01:51.235 --> 00:01:56.535
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:56.585 --> 00:01:57.735
Fly!

21
00:01:58.685 --> 00:02:04.463
Value corner: Perseverance. Trying again after a mistake helps us learn and grow.

22
00:02:04.513 --> 00:02:06.417
I can show perseverance too!

23
00:02:07.163 --> 00:02:14.288
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:14.338 --> 00:02:15.866
Bye-bye, friends!

